sequenceDiagram
  participant User as 用户
  participant FE as 用户端
  participant BE as Spring Boot后端
  participant AI as AI Scoring服务
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant FS as 文件/MinIO

  User->>FE: 上传视频或选择会议录制
  FE->>BE: POST /api/ai-score/upload-session 或 /sessions
  BE->>DB: 创建 ai_scoring_session
  BE->>FS: 保存媒体文件或记录录制引用
  FE->>BE: POST /api/ai-score/sessions/{id}/start
  BE->>AI: POST /api/ai/score-session
  AI->>FS: 读取视频/材料
  AI->>AI: 音频提取/ASR/视觉帧/证据抽取
  AI->>AI: 规则评分/LLM分析/报告生成
  AI->>BE: POST /api/ai-score/sessions/{id}/pipeline-callback
  BE->>DB: 写入 report/observations/deductions/anchors
  FE->>BE: GET /api/ai-score/sessions/{id}/status
  FE->>BE: GET /api/ai-score/reports/by-session/{id}
  BE-->>FE: 返回报告与证据链
